# Session Log

Cross-machine continuity log for Claude Code sessions on this project.
This file is tracked in git so it can be synced between laptops (commit + push / pull).

Newest entries at the top. Each entry: date, machine (optional), summary of
what was done, decisions made, and what's next.

---

## 2026-09-25
- Added project-level and global (`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`) notes: how to
  reauthenticate with Google (`gcloud auth login` +
  `gcloud auth application-default login`), and a documentation style
  rule (no em-dashes, write in simple, clear, complete sentences).
- User asked for a TLS publisher sample with cert/key/trust store,
  endpoint, topic, and QoS. Found `ZenohJavaTlsPub.java` and
  `runTlsPub.bat` already implement all of this (added in an earlier
  session, commit 7a5094d) but were never documented in README.md or
  API.md.
- Fixed a real bug in `runTlsPub.bat`: the `set CA=` line was dropped
  in commit d2f1ca4 ("changed cert path"), so the CA root path being
  passed to the Java sample was empty. Restored it and corrected the
  stale cert/key hash in the `--help` text.
- Documented `ZenohJavaTlsPub` / `runTlsPub.bat` in README.md (Layout
  tree, Build & run block, new "mTLS publisher with QoS" section) and
  added it to the sample list at the top of API.md.
- Verified with `mvn -q package` after the fix; build passes.
- Next: nothing pending on this thread. Normal project work continues.

